---
componentName:  neoarch
name:           NeoArch Linux
displayName:    NeoArch Linux
version:        2026.06
shortDescription: |
    A performant, purple-themed Arch-based distribution.
description: |
    NeoArch Linux is an optimized Arch-based distribution featuring
    a stunning purple theme, performance enhancements, and an easy
    graphical installer powered by Calamares.

    Features:
    - Arch Linux base with latest packages
    - Linux-zen kernel for optimal desktop performance
    - BTRFS filesystem with automatic snapshots
    - KDE Plasma desktop with custom purple theming
    - Pre-configured for gaming and development
    - ZRAM for improved memory management
    - GUI installer for easy setup

    System Requirements:
    - 64-bit x86_64 processor
    - 4GB RAM (8GB recommended)
    - 30GB storage (64GB+ recommended)
    - UEFI or BIOS boot

